<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile rejects nickel bids.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile rejects nickel bids.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said Thursday that it rejected all bids to buy surplus nickel at its monthly bid opening.</p>
<p>The next bid opening for nickel is December 12, the agency said.</p>
